{15}{The orcs are striking for a union again. Won't they ever learn? [A look of realization crosses his face.] But that's no excuse for a lack of manners, now, is it? [He offers his hand for you to shake.] I'm Capt. Wheeler of the Tarantian Guard.}{The orcs are striking for a union again. Won't they ever learn? [A look of realization crosses his face.] But that's no excuse for a lack of manners, now, is it? [He offers his hand for you to shake.] I'm Capt. Wheeler of the Tarantian Guard.}{}{}{}{lf1 1 }
